==Strategy==
It is heavily recommended to have obtained all of the [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] From [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1 & 2, as well as the first one from Chapter 3. For this reason, it is best to deal as much damage as possible to the Bun Bun Black before the Bun Bun Symbiote shows up. This is best achieved with high-ramge attackers like [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] and [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]], as long as you keep him in place with crowd-controllers like [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]]. Use the opening to first spawn your expensive attackers, e.g. [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], then go from there.

Against Bun Bun Symbiote, it shouldn't be too diffirent from Bun Bun Black aside from the occasional Wave Attack. If you have [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] by this point, he can nullify them, but even just Sadako Cat already provides a good enough defensive wall against both major threats here.

